# cp cloudflare.ini.example cloudflare.ini && chmod 600 cloudflare.ini, then
# paste the token. On proxy it goes to /etc/letsencrypt/cloudflare.ini (root,
# mode 600). Keep a copy in the password manager.
#
# A Cloudflare API token with Zone → DNS → Edit on strycks.dpdns.org only
# (docs/infra/runbook.md → First setup → proxy).
dns_cloudflare_api_token = change-me
